// selfhost/ir/lib.mty
//
// Self-hosted MtyIR — v0.9 SHIPPED-SUBSET.
//
// This is the package entry-point for the self-hosted MtyIR (mid-level
// IR) phase of the Mighty compiler. It documents the intended module
// layout once cross-file resolution lands; today everything is
// consolidated into `lower.mty` because the v0.8 driver still compiles
// one `.mty` file at a time (see SELFHOST_HIR_V0_8_NOTES.md gap #1).
//
// ## Intended v1.0+ layout
//
//   selfhost.ir
//   ├── lib.mty       — this file: re-exports + package decl
//   ├── nodes.mty     — IR data shape (IrFn, IrBlock, IrStmt, IrTerm,
//   │                   IrLocal, IrRvalue, IrTy)
//   └── lower.mty     — HIR → MtyIR lowering (runnable, v0.9 subset)
//
// ## Current v0.9 layout (single-file compile workaround)
//
// The runnable lowerer + bridge live in `lower.mty`. `nodes.mty`
// remains the data-shape spec.
//
// ## Status
//
// - `nodes.mty` — `mty check` clean (documentation-only package decl)
// - `lower.mty` — `mty check` clean, services the v0.9 bootstrap test
//
// See `crates/mty-driver/tests/selfhost_ir.rs` for the bootstrap
// runner.

package selfhost_ir
